        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "White hankerchief with red border. Each corner has a stream of beige trucks/soldiers leading from the corner towards the center of the hankerchief. Each stream is accompanied by a flag (Russian, USA, British, French) and separated from one another by airplanes and battleships. In the center is a building with the word \"BERLIN\" printed in red on top."@en ;
